title:  Media remote: Play/Pause, Next, Prev, Vol +/- for the phone, from the overview (Quick Status "Multimedia Control")
desc:   Bluetooth HID consumer-control service; Quick Status "Light Control" is renamed "Multimedia Control"; switched on and with no smart light connected, the overview shows a Media box (|◀◀ ▶‖ ▶▶|, ♪− ♪+). After installing, forget the S510 in the phone's Bluetooth settings and pair it again from the Bryton app (once). Only tested with an iPhone so far.
source: patches/P7-media-remote.c, docs/how-it-works.md (P7)
